7           ý        7        &        dead:grave
8           á        8        *        dead:abovedot
9           í        9        {        dead:acute
0           é        0        }        dead:doubleacute
minus       =        %        \        dead:diaeresis
equal       dead:acute dead:caron dead:macron dead:cedilla
